      },
      "message": "docs(readme): explain the draft -> ready-for-review gates\n\nContributing gains 'Draft first, then ready for review: the gates': every\nPR opens as a draft; it goes ready on the maintainer's word or when its\nown gates pass (mergeable, quick gate green, complete description, the\nAGENTS.md laws - .cps post scripts exempt from the line limit); a ready\nPR takes no more pushes without going back to draft; and the review's\nthree label colours (merge-ready / needs-rework / conflicts). The owner-\nPR review bullet now matches the current flow.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
