      "message": "docs: quick-pass ready rule and owner-PR reviews in AGENTS.md and review-prs\n\nReview of #293: the README described two rules AGENTS.md did not have yet.\nAGENTS.md 'Every PR opens as a draft' now says a quick pass (no rebuild)\nover the gates flags a PR ready, with the full review after (user,\n2026-11-08: \"the quickpass was to make em ready for review.. so flag\nem\"); 'Outside PRs are reviewed' now covers owner PRs once ready (user,\n2026-11-08: \"All PR*s made by owner should be reviewd and tagged\") and\nnames the three review labels. review-prs step 1 lists owner PRs too.\nREADME: the quick-pass wording no longer contradicts the tested gate, the\nlabel table says the reviewer turns the PR back into a draft, and the\nmarker reads <head sha>.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
