      "message": "docs: review-prs labels and back-to-draft agree with AGENTS.md; Fixes/Refs only for issue PRs\n\nRe-review of #293: step 3 no longer forbids the labels step 2b sets;\nstep 2b turns a red or orange owner PR back into a draft (a fork PR is left\nas its contributor set it); the README's description gate asks for\nFixes/Refs only when the PR works an issue. The PR-reviewer agent\ndefinition is left untouched here: another session holds uncommitted edits\nto it in the main checkout.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
